      "summary": "Mateenah’s BlueDot sprint compared four refusal directions. In a follow-up designed and run by Codex, changing “When did” to “In what year did” reduced Qwen’s political refusals from 20 to four across 30 names. SmolLM2 gave no full refusals in 180 replies.",
